@1 = ~Urgh, Bronya is so pathetic. She tells everyone I overprice my wares, but at least my products are of fine quality, unlike her barely thrown-together cakes. If you need cookies or honey, here I am. I'll take flour or eggs off your hands, too.~
@2 = ~Let me see what you have for sale.~
@3 = ~I have some flour. Will you pay 65 gold pieces?~
@4 = ~I have some eggs. Will you pay 25 gold pieces?~
@5 = ~Maybe another time.~
